{"id":"916836dbb5b34f34","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-incompleteness-two-forms.md","title":"Incompleteness Two Forms","display":"lem-incompleteness-two-forms — Incompleteness Two Forms","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-incompleteness-two-forms","aliases":["92-lem-incompleteness-two-forms"],"display":"lem-incompleteness-two-forms — Incompleteness Two Forms","depends_on":["[[92-thm-first-incompleteness]]","[[92-thm-omega-incompleteness]]","[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","[[92-df-omega-consistency]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","[[92-df-substitution]]","[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-elementary-system]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-axiom-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-incompleteness-two-forms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-incompleteness-two-forms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-incompleteness-two-forms — Incompleteness Two Forms"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02b34261c2cb199c\" href=\"?note=02b34261c2cb199c\" title=\"92-thm-first-incompleteness\">92-thm-first-incompleteness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7a453a6b0e34f3a9\" href=\"?note=7a453a6b0e34f3a9\" title=\"92-thm-omega-incompleteness\">92-thm-omega-incompleteness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b15ebe94f199828c\" href=\"?note=b15ebe94f199828c\" title=\"92-df-omega-consistency\">92-df-omega-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (omega-consistency predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"b15ebe94f199828c\" href=\"?note=b15ebe94f199828c\" title=\"92-df-omega-consistency\">92-df-omega-consistency</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G,\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G,\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (sentence and formula sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (distinguished variable, free variables, substitution, and numerals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span> (effectivity and arithmetic-strength conditions)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}two\\text{-}forms}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\land\n\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\n\\exists\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;(G\\nvdash\\gamma\\land G\\nvdash\\neg\\gamma)\n\\land\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\psi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nG\\vdash\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\psi,\\bar n,v_0)\n\\land G\\nvdash\\forall v_0\\,\\psi\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}two\\text{-}forms}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\land\n\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\n\\exists\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;(G\\nvdash\\gamma\\land G\\nvdash\\neg\\gamma)\n\\land\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\psi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nG\\vdash\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\psi,\\bar n,v_0)\n\\land G\\nvdash\\forall v_0\\,\\psi\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对本书固定的递归PA系统，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性同时给出两种不完备性见证</li>\n<li>(A) 句法不完备：存在不可判定句子</li>\n<li>(B) <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>不完备：对所有numeral可证但不能证明全称</li>\n<li>联系：对所得Gödel句<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span>，可从内部证明公式<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\)</span>把结论变量代为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner}\">\\(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner}\\)</span>并否定，得到仅余证明码变量自由的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>；外部<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\)</span>不能直接写入<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>公式</li>\n<li>所有numeral实例均以<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\psi,\\bar n,v_0)\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\psi,\\bar n,v_0)\\)</span>表示，避免把公式误当成元语言函数</li>\n<li>这不是把两个任意存在命题无条件声明为逻辑等价；结论来自同一Gödel构造</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-thm-first-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"02b34261c2cb199c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-first-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-omega-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"7a453a6b0e34f3a9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-omega-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved